  "description": "3D and 2D spatial indices (uniform grid, k-d tree, octree, BVH, AABB grid) with nearest / k-NN / radius / segment / ray / box / all-pairs queries on points, segments, spheres, triangles, polylines, and user-defined items. Includes a pure-geometry layer in both float and double precision (Vector3d, Plane3D, Triangle3D, Sphere3D, Polyline3D/2D, OrientedBounds3D, BezierCurve2D), rigid transforms (Quaternion + Transform3D), best-fit primitives (line, plane, sphere, circle, principal axes), snap/weld/quantize utilities, 2D path classification (triangle / rectangle / revision-cloud / polygon / polyline), 2D Delaunay triangulation, Bentley-Ottmann segment intersection, mesh inside/outside testing, and SpatialBenchmark — an empirical \"which structure is fastest for my data\" harness. Multi-targets netstandard2.0 + net8.0.",
